      "slug": "gram:n3-nazenara",
      "variants": [],
      "steps_unavailable": "Clause-initial conjunction with an obligatory tail on a SEPARATE clause. The record's formation is: main sentence, then なぜなら + reason + から / のだ / からだ. なぜなら opens a new sentence and applies no operation to any base, and the closed op set has no prepend; steps carrying only the から(だ) tail would emit the ordinary causal から, which the record itself contrasts with this point.",
